{
    "id": "first-dashboard-infinity",
    "title": "Build your first dashboard",
    "blocks": [{
            "type": "conditional",
            "conditions": ["has-datasource:yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource"],
            "description": "Pre-flight check. Infinity is pre-provisioned as grafanacloud-infinity for orgs created on/after 2024-10-01; older orgs may not have it. Re-evaluates live, so this notice disappears once a data source is added.",
            "whenTrue": [],
            "whenFalse": [{
                "type": "markdown",
                "content": "**Before you begin.** This guide uses the **Infinity** data source, which is included with new Grafana Cloud stacks but is missing from yours. To add it, go to **Connections** > **Add new connection**, search for **Infinity**, click **Install**, then **Add new data source** and **Save & test**. This notice disappears once Infinity is available."
            }]
        },
        {
            "type": "markdown",
            "content": "Get a working dashboard in a few clicks. No data of your own needed. You'll load a small public JSON file and create a table with the data."
        },
        {
            "type": "section",
            "id": "build-dashboard",
            "title": "Build the dashboard",
            "requirements": ["has-datasource:yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource"],
            "blocks": [{
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "action": "navigate",
                    "reftarget": "/dashboard/new",
                    "verify": "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                    "content": "Create a new dashboard."
                },
                {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "action": "highlight",
                    "reftarget": "button[data-testid='data-testid Dashboard Sidebar new button']",
                    "requirements": ["on-page:/dashboard/new", "exists-reftarget"],
                    "content": "Click **+**."
                },
                {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "action": "highlight",
                    "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid sidebar add new panel']",
                    "requirements": ["on-page:/dashboard/new", "exists-reftarget"],
                    "content": "Click **Panel**."
                },
                {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "action": "highlight",
                    "reftarget": "button[data-testid='data-testid UnconfiguredPanel action-button configure']",
                    "requirements": ["on-page:/dashboard/new", "exists-reftarget"],
                    "content": "Click **Configure visualization**."
                },
                {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "action": "formfill",
                    "reftarget": "input[data-testid='data-testid Select a data source']",
                    "targetvalue": "grafanacloud-infinity",
                    "requirements": ["on-page:/dashboard/new", "exists-reftarget"],
                    "content": "Use the data source picker to select **grafanacloud-infinity**."
                },
                {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "action": "formfill",
                    "reftarget": "[data-testid='infinity-query-url-input']",
                    "targetvalue": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana-infinity-datasource/main/testdata/users.json",
                    "requirements": ["on-page:/dashboard/new", "exists-reftarget"],
                    "content": "In the **URL** field, enter \n\n`https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana-infinity-datasource/main/testdata/users.json`"
                },
                {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "action": "highlight",
                    "reftarget": "button[data-testid='data-testid Tab Visualizations']",
                    "requirements": ["on-page:/dashboard/new", "exists-reftarget"],
                    "content": "Click **All visualizations**."
                },
                {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "action": "highlight",
                    "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid Plugin visualization item Table']",
                    "requirements": ["on-page:/dashboard/new", "exists-reftarget"],
                    "content": "Select **Table**."
                },
                {
                    "type": "multistep",
                    "requirements": ["on-page:/dashboard/new"],
                    "content": "Click **Save** and name the dashboard `My first dashboard`.",
                    "steps": [{
                            "action": "highlight",
                            "reftarget": "button[data-testid='data-testid Save dashboard button']",
                            "requirements": ["exists-reftarget"]
                        },
                        {
                            "action": "formfill",
                            "reftarget": "input[aria-label='Save dashboard title field']",
                            "targetvalue": "My first dashboard",
                            "requirements": ["exists-reftarget"]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "action": "highlight",
                    "reftarget": "button[data-testid='data-testid Save dashboard drawer button']",
                    "requirements": ["on-page:/dashboard/new", "exists-reftarget"],
                    "verify": "has-dashboard-named:My first dashboard",
                    "content": "Click **Save**."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "markdown",
            "content": "You have a saved dashboard with a live table. Swap the URL for any JSON or CSV endpoint to show your own data."
        }
    ]
}